EVALUATE
// The Conservative to Optimistic range under the summary's hours, as its own
// query: the app asks it beside executive-summary.dax, under the same filters,
// so the summary's figures don't wait for it. On a large tenant it took about a
// quarter of the summary's time. Both columns are as they were in the summary.
ROW(
    "Hours Conservative", CALCULATE([Expert Equivalent Hours], 'Effort Scenario'[Scenario] = "Conservative"),
    "Hours Optimistic", CALCULATE([Expert Equivalent Hours], 'Effort Scenario'[Scenario] = "Optimistic")
)
